        "key": "ad4e1417f4d280398df3",
        "date": "2026-01-26",
        "title": "Complete Service",
        "body": "Generator service:\n- Replace generator oil.\n- Replace generator oil filter.\n- Replace primary fuel filter.\n- Replace secondary fuel filter.\n- Prime fuel system.\n- Inspect fuel lines, connections and clamps.\n- Clean sea strainer.\n- Replace raw water pump impeller and end plate gasket.\n- Replace sacrificial anode.\n- Inspect all raw water cooling system hoses, clamps and\nconnections.\n- Inspect fresh water cooling system hoses, clamps and\nconnections.\n- Inspect exhaust system.\n- Inspect generator mounts.\nTest run:\n- Carry out pre-start inspections.\n- Start generator.\n- Monitor and record all gauge readings at idle.\n- Run generator up to operating temperature and inspect\ngenerator with thermal imaging camera.\n- Inspect generator for any faults or running issues.\n- Apply load to generator and monitor.\n- Shut down generator.\n- Inspect generator for any leaks.\n\nDetail:\n- Clean bilge beneath generator and engine room surfaces.",
